# The siege arm that hits the wallet: arty + a three-unit raid party.
#
# Against 1.8x income every even trade loses long-run, and seven screening
# rounds of fire discipline moved trades without converting (log
# 2026-07-31). The raid verb strikes the enemy's extractors directly --
# every one dropped is 1.8x-scaled income gone -- and it has never ridden
# with the artillery mix or the kill-group fire code. Its old neutral
# measurement predates both.

name aa-counter-guard-arty-raid
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 0
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 0
close 0
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
